# Nothing public: every hop rides the tailnet.
title: Zero-trust private infrastructure
subtitle: Tailscale

Mac [icon: laptop]
iPhone [icon: phone]
Internet [icon: globe, muted]

Tailnet {
  Home LAN [dashed] {
    OptiPlex [icon: router, note: subnet router]
    homelab-server [icon: server, note: Docker · AdGuard]
  }
  Cloud [dashed] {
    Edge VPS [icon: cloud, note: Caddy · Uptime Kuma]
  }
}

Mac > OptiPlex: WireGuard
iPhone > Edge VPS: WireGuard
OptiPlex > homelab-server
Internet -- Edge VPS: dropped [muted]
